[{"answer":"John, I've just had some good news.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Susan has had her baby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know when she had it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/4.mp3"},{"answer":"The 10th of August.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, my father was born on August the 10th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Give me the details and I'll make a note for everyone at work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, was it a boy or a girl?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a boy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And what are they going to call him?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Tom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Tom Lightfoot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds quite good, don't you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that has quite a good ring to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/15.mp3"},{"answer":"You know he's quite a big baby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He weighed 4.25 kilos when he was born.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/17.mp3"},{"answer":"That does sound big, 4.25 kilos.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And he's long too, 46 centimetres.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmmm. Tall parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/20.mp3"},{"answer":"He'll grow up to be over 2 metres, I'd say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/21.mp3"},{"answer":"With masses of black hair, curly black hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, we should go and visit them in hospital.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/23.mp3"},{"answer":"What about tomorrow afternoon at around 1 pm?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Where should we meet?...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, I could come and pick you up at your house, if you like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that would be wonderful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/28.mp3"},{"answer":"My car is still off the road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Just refresh my memory....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/30.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the address again?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 15 Chesterfield Road, Paddington.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's next to the library, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Not exactly. It's next to a bank.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The State Bank actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The library is opposite us, on the corner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's a garage on the other street corner. I remember now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So, you'll pick me up at 12.45","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll be there at one easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what should we take?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/41.mp3"},{"answer":"We must take them something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I always think flowers are good to take to someone in hospital, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone always brings flowers and they don't last.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's much better to take a pot plant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/46.mp3"},{"answer":"so she can take it home with her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but then she has to remember to water it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/48.mp3"},{"answer":"What about a big box of chocolates?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, chocolates sound fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/50.mp3"},{"answer":"We should get something for the baby too. What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/52.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think of something like baby shampoo or talcum powder?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Or we could get a little hat, or something like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/54.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't know the size, or the right colour, do we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we should get something they wouldn't normally buy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/56.mp3"},{"answer":"What about a soft toy of some sort?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, a soft toy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/58.mp3"},{"answer":"What about a teddy bear?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I could get one early tomorrow at the market","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and I could probably get the chocolates there too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/62.mp3"},{"answer":"So you'll pick me up at a quarter to one at my place","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'll make sure that I've got the presents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/64.mp3"},{"answer":"You must remember how much you paid for the gifts,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/65.mp3"},{"answer":"so I can pay you back for half.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/66.mp3"},{"answer":"If they're going to be from both of us, I would like to go shares.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say the chocolates would be about $15 for something nice and not too small","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and the toy would be around $35 or so, I'd think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, that'll be fine. About $25 each then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, I'll pick you up then on Sunday at 12.45.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/73.mp3"},{"answer":"See you then. Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-1-2023-08-20-18-52-26/74.mp3"}]
